WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.339
Welcome to Mandarin with Royal Crest.

2
00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:08.369
We follow HSK, the official Chinese syllabus

3
00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:12.582
used by Confucius Institutes around the world.

4
00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:15.805
Level one, lesson one: greetings.

5
00:00:17.305 --> 00:00:19.075
To say hello to a friend:

6
00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:20.691
你好！  nǐ hǎo
Hello

7
00:00:21.091 --> 00:00:22.408
你好！  nǐ hǎo
Hello

8
00:00:23.007 --> 00:00:26.527
Tip: when two third tones meet, the first one rises.

9
00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:31.521
To greet a teacher or an elder, use the polite form:

10
00:00:31.821 --> 00:00:33.085
您好！  nín hǎo
Hello (polite)

11
00:00:33.485 --> 00:00:34.749
您好！  nín hǎo
Hello (polite)

12
00:00:36.549 --> 00:00:38.266
To greet a whole group:

13
00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.066
你们好！  nǐ men hǎo
Hello, everyone

14
00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:41.965
你们好！  nǐ men hǎo
Hello, everyone

15
00:00:43.766 --> 00:00:45.170
To say thank you:

16
00:00:45.469 --> 00:00:46.603
谢谢！  xiè xie
Thank you

17
00:00:47.003 --> 00:00:48.137
谢谢！  xiè xie
Thank you

18
00:00:48.737 --> 00:00:50.872
And the reply, you're welcome:

19
00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:52.619
不客气！  bú kè qi
You’re welcome

20
00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.466
不客气！  bú kè qi
You’re welcome

21
00:00:56.266 --> 00:00:57.513
To say sorry:

22
00:00:57.813 --> 00:00:59.365
对不起！  duì bu qǐ
Sorry

23
00:00:59.765 --> 00:01:01.317
对不起！  duì bu qǐ
Sorry

24
00:01:01.917 --> 00:01:03.634
And the reply, it's okay:

25
00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:05.433
没关系！  méi guān xi
It’s okay

26
00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.332
没关系！  méi guān xi
It’s okay

27
00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:10.667
And to say goodbye:

28
00:01:10.967 --> 00:01:12.336
再见！  zài jiàn
Goodbye

29
00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:14.105
再见！  zài jiàn
Goodbye

30
00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:18.146
Now, in a Royal Crest classroom.

31
00:01:18.196 --> 00:01:19.634
The lesson begins:

32
00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:21.355
老师好！  lǎoshī hǎo
Hello, teacher

33
00:01:21.955 --> 00:01:23.559
同学们好！  tóngxuémen hǎo
Hello, class

34
00:01:24.159 --> 00:01:25.824
And when the lesson ends:

35
00:01:26.124 --> 00:01:28.825
谢谢老师！老师再见！  xièxie lǎoshī! lǎoshī zàijiàn!
Thank you, teacher! Goodbye, teacher!

36
00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:36.282
Your challenge today: greet a teacher in Mandarin, and thank a friend.

37
00:01:36.332 --> 00:01:38.194
Next lesson: numbers.

38
00:01:38.493 --> 00:01:39.862
再见！  zài jiàn
Goodbye
